OL,3,GNEWSA'I was broken and lost' before
OL,4,Aemployment help
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who felt "broken and lost" after
OL,7,Fdropping out of university said a
OL,8,Fcharity's employment training helped
OL,9,Ftransform his life.
OL,11,FMontague Scott, 23, from Emersons
OL,12,FGreen, South Gloucestershire, said he
OL,13,F"did not know what to do" before being
OL,14,Freferred to employment charity Spear,
OL,15,Fwhich helped him secure an
OL,16,Fapprenticeship with National Grid.
OL,18,FIn Bristol, Spear supports up to 10
OL,19,Fpeople aged 16-24 each month, helping
OL,20,Fthem develop skills needed to move into
OL,21,Fwork, education or training.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
